  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who hold or are exposed to racialized economic stereotypes, particularly those who perceive Black people as morally failing or lazy for relying on others for economic support. The meme is designed to resonate with audiences familiar with 'welfare dependency tropes' and 'lazy/unemployed characterizations,' and who may use or endorse the idea of 'relying on your enemy' as a moral judgment. The visual of a Black man in business attire is leveraged to reinforce these stereotypes, targeting communities that accept or perpetuate racialized narratives about economic behavior.",
